{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>Hamster City</strong>, where every road and building fuels your food-gathering empire! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/extras/7649ade84587f71f3db616e71cd7e0f1.poster.avif?t=1738788261\" width=450 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/extras/7649ade84587f71f3db616e71cd7e0f1.webm?t=1738788261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/extras/7649ade84587f71f3db616e71cd7e0f1.mp4?t=1738788261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build infrastructure, unlock unique buildings, and watch your hamsters thrive as you climb the leaderboard to become the ultimate Chief!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/extras/d88afb658f92e7f5bd04bd789c610c01.poster.avif?t=1738788261\" width=450 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/extras/d88afb658f92e7f5bd04bd789c610c01.webm?t=1738788261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/extras/d88afb658f92e7f5bd04bd789c610c01.mp4?t=1738788261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Expand:</strong> Construct roads and add buildings to create a city that maximizes food gathering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up and Compete:</strong> Upgrade buildings to gain an edge and compete on the global leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic City Planning:</strong> Each road, building, and upgrade can give you an advantage in gathering resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Structures:</strong> Discover new buildings that add layers of strategy to your hamster-led empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Idler in the Background:</strong> Hamster City runs while you\u2019re away, letting you focus on other tasks and return to find your city thriving!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/extras/c72e13cc1eb87b3e4b04338c2cacec37.poster.avif?t=1738788261\" width=274 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/extras/c72e13cc1eb87b3e4b04338c2cacec37.webm?t=1738788261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/extras/c72e13cc1eb87b3e4b04338c2cacec37.mp4?t=1738788261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on our Discord to become beta testers!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3195320?t=1738788261","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738788261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/c803771e1c2ea305439d5489ab0ef18286fcdd33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738788261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195320/c803771e1c2ea305439d5489ab0ef18286fcdd33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738788261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3492790,"description":""}],"detailed_de